#====================================================================
# Draft: Upstream test/sample sources using Windows backslash include
#        paths ("..\..\code\foo.h") fail to compile on POSIX — convert
#        to forward slashes (lib_fts 1.2.8)
#====================================================================

id:                     DRAFT-LIB_FTS-1.2.8-WINDOWS-BACKSLASH-INCLUDE
trigger_tool:           clang|clang++|gcc|make|cmake
phase:                  compile
error_signature:        fatal error: '\.\.\\\.\.\\code\\|file not found|no such file or directory.*\\\\include|'\\\\' file not found

severity:               2
category:               platform, compat, portability, build-system
match_keywords:         Windows, backslash, include, 反斜杠, POSIX, file not found, .cpp, tests, sample, msvc

title:                  上游测试/样例源码使用 Windows 反斜杠 include 路径（`..\..\code\foo.h`），POSIX 编译器按字面解析导致 'file not found' — 补丁改为正斜杠即可

root_cause:             Windows 优先开发的上游项目测试源常写 `#include "..\..\code\fts_fuzzy_match.h"`（反斜杠）。POSIX 文件系统中 `\` 是普通字符，路径按字面拼接无法解析 → clang 报 `fatal error: '..\..\code\...' file not found`。这不是平台宏问题（R8 无涉），是源码字面路径的平台可移植缺陷。

affected_scope:         Any upstream project whose test/sample/example sources use Windows backslash include or file paths, when built on POSIX (Linux/OHOS). Verified instance: lib_fts 1.2.8 tests/fuzzy_match/fts_fuzzy_match_test.cpp 两处 `#include "..\..\code\..."`。

verification_cmd:       clang++ -std=c++17 -I code tests/fuzzy_match/fts_fuzzy_match_test.cpp -o fts_test_upstream

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           patch-backslash-include-to-forward-slash
rec_description:        在 patches/ 中用最小补丁将反斜杠 include/路径改写为正斜杠（`..\..\code\` → `../../code/`），保持其余内容不变。补丁格式 a/b 前缀 + patch -p1 可应用（已用干净 .orig 验证）。仅当上游确实包含反斜杠路径时使用；不要引入 __OHOS__ 宏。
rec_command:            git diff 生成补丁并放入 patches/0001-*.patch；conan create 复验
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               archives/l/lib_fts/1.2.8/patches/0001-tests-fuzzy_match-fts_fuzzy_match_test.cpp.patch

fallback_priority:      0
fallback_approach:
fallback_description:
fallback_command:
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl: